      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} All those issues disappear around the time main menu 2.0 came out.\n\nUpright only change with player input. Menu and station don't affect it anymore.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
